<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79064" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραφυλ-άσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραφύλ-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>watch beside, guard closely</i>,
			of soldiers in garrison, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώραν,
			πόλιν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.3.7
			</span></i>, etc. (
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				5.92.8
			</span></i>) : metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὴν ἐλευθερίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.58.2
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τισὶ τὸ ἀνεπηρέαστον</span>
			<i>protect, maintain</i> their immunity, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1106.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span> : abs., <i>to be on guard</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Galb.</u>
				20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>watch, observe narrowly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τῆς νεὼς . . ἀεὶ ξυμφέρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Plt.</u>
					297a
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν φαῦλον παραφυλάττειν δεῖ,
			μή</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				87
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἀλλήλους, ἐὰν</span>. .
				<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Lac.</u>
				4.4
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καιρὸν π. ἐν ᾧ</span> . .
				<i>watch for</i> a time at which. . , <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.775e
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπ᾽ ὀφθαλμοῦ π. [τινά]</span>
			<i>keep</i> one <i>in sight</i>, of a dog following and watching
			a person, ib.<i><span class="en">
				969f
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>watch so as to secure</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π.[τινὰς] ὥστε εἶναι φίλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					628a
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. αὑτόν, μὴ</span> . . <i>to
				be on</i> one's <i>guard</i>, lest . . , <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.418d
			</span></i> :—
				Med.
			, <i>to be on one's guard</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				951a18
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τι</span>
			<i>stand on one's guard against</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				16.14.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>to be guarded, be careful</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Plt.</u>
					284a
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἀλλήλους ὅπως μὴ</span> .
			. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				715a
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπως</span>. . <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.Al.</u>
				1424a22
			</span></i> :—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. μὴ . . τάττειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					2.26.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>serve as</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραφύλαξ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Jahresh.</u>
				8.172
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Notium</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ath.Mitt.</u>
				8.328
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Tralles</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
